      <profiles>
        <profile name="Hive Mind Direction" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability" hidden="false" id="d093-788e-d736-2f3d">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit is Activated while it has Hive Minded, this unit gains the following ability until the next time it is Activated:


Terror Skirmishers: For each attack that targets this unit while it is the closest of your units to the attacking unit, the Hit Roll for that attack is worsened by 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Screaming Swarm" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability" hidden="false" id="2ce9-d17b-9099-8355">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">If this unit has no leader model, after this unit's End step, if this turn was your first turn in a row, take another turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Psychic Powers of the Zoanthropes (Reference)" hidden="false" id="5d67-6ad6-9a8b-0be4" sortIndex="-4">
      <constraints>
        <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true" id="f4c7-ee89-2232-154c" includeChildSelections="false" />
        <constraint type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true" id="c26a-edab-3612-8b58" includeChildSelections="false" />
        <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true" id="452f-6463-c226-4602" includeChildSelections="false" />
      </constraints>
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink name="Configuration" hidden="false" id="49e1-7e19-2b09-e44d" targetId="9cd6-0442-3f35-6b52" primary="true" />
      </categoryLinks>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="1 Hypnotic Gaze" typeId="6406-cf2b-ec5b-c7e6" typeName="Psychic Power" hidden="false" id="0d70-ad02-068b-0121">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4b9e-dc73-b312-b42d">Select a visible enemy unit within 24". Until the next time this unit is Activated or dies, the selected enemy unit cannot be selected for Activation unless their controlling player has no other units available for Activation. Then, roll a D6. On a 1-3, this unit loses 2 Health.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="2 Dominion" typeId="6406-cf2b-ec5b-c7e6" typeName="Psychic Power" hidden="false" id="8af4-fc5f-c530-11f1">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4b9e-dc73-b312-b42d">Select one of your other ready units within 12" of this unit. After this unit's End step, you may take another turn. During that turn, for each attack the selected unit makes, add 2 to the Hit Roll for that attack. Then, roll a D6. On a 1-3, this unit loses 3 Health.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="3 Paroxysm" typeId="6406-cf2b-ec5b-c7e6" typeName="Psychic Power" hidden="false" id="ab1b-1929-f2fd-cd38">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4b9e-dc73-b312-b42d">Select up to three different enemy infantry or monster units within 16" of this unit. Each selected unit suffers 7 Suppression. Then, roll a D6. On a 1-3, this unit loses 5 Health.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="4 Warp Lance" typeId="6406-cf2b-ec5b-c7e6" typeName="Psychic Power" hidden="false" id="bc0c-9582-3e98-99f6">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4b9e-dc73-b312-b42d">After you would select targets for this unit this turn, select an enemy unit within 16" of and visible to this unit. The selected unit suffers XD6+6 SW where X is equal to the selected units Toughness. Then, roll a D6. On a 1-3, this unit loses 5 Health.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="5 Warp Blast" typeId="6406-cf2b-ec5b-c7e6" typeName="Psychic Power" hidden="false" id="a523-aef4-bae3-069c">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4b9e-dc73-b312-b42d">After you would select targets for this unit this turn, select an enemy unit within 16" of and visible to this unit. That unit and all other units within 2D6" of that unit each suffer D6+4 SW. Then, roll a D6. On a 1-3, this unit loses 5 Health.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="6 Hateful Will" typeId="6406-cf2b-ec5b-c7e6" typeName="Psychic Power" hidden="false" id="7ea2-0b70-f56e-6970">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4b9e-dc73-b312-b42d">After you would select targets for this unit this turn, select an enemy unit within 16" of and visible to this unit. The selected unit suffers 2D6+12 SW. Then, roll a D6. On a 1-3, this unit loses 5 Health.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
