          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit's Move Roll during its Move step, you may discard the highest dice of that Move Roll. If you do, after the Move step, this unit gains Anchored Discharge until the End step. Otherwise, it gains Rampaging Assault until the End step.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
