    <selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="Maleceptor" hidden="false" id="2663-e3a6-0526-f310" sortIndex="1">
      <costs>
        <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="180" />
      </costs>
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink targetId="ccc6-6202-853c-23e4" id="c039-a4d0-309c-73b6" primary="true" name="Support" />
        <categoryLink targetId="6537-7b2d-b2c8-6005" id="71dc-79fb-2e8e-6722" primary="false" name="Monster" />
      </categoryLinks>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Windfall of the Warp, Dominating Shadow" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability" hidden="false" id="79cd-432d-2972-a61e">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit makes a Psychic Test, if that Psychic Test had two or more dice with the same result, select one enemy unit within 12+3D6" of this unit. The selected unit suffers 2 Suppression. If the selected unit has Psyker, that unit suffers 3 Suppression instead.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Roiling Tides" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability" hidden="false" id="b037-5070-d766-c97a">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">Once per battle round, while selecting an enemy unit for Windfall of the Warp, Dominating Shadow, instead of selecting an enemy unit, you may select all enemy units within 12+3D6" of this unit. If you do, those suffer 4 Suppression instead. If any of the selected units have Psyker, those units suffer 6 Suppression instead.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Neuropredatory Spears" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability" hidden="false" id="2584-a132-89ca-89d0">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit makes a Psychic Test, for each dice in that Psychic Test, select one different enemy unit within X+4", where X is the total result of that Psychic Test. That unit suffers SW equal to the result on that dice.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <selectionEntries>
        <selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Maleceptor" hidden="false" id="da52-4641-524e-c367">
          <constraints>
            <constraint type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="da52-4641-524e-c367-min" includeChildSelections="false" />
            <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="da52-4641-524e-c367-max" includeChildSelections="false" />
          </constraints>
          <profiles>
            <profile name="Maleceptor" typeId="a706-96eb-fcae-b696" typeName="Unit" hidden="false" id="d5bc-f937-5a10-2fa6">
              <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="T" typeId="a6ad-d820-8495-f5b0">5</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="9b7f-0dde-683f-6844">4+</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="H" typeId="18e4-1bf9-a9b8-1e50">10</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Rv" typeId="411f-3942-6dc0-7c06">5+</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
