    <selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="Biovore" hidden="false" id="ffb7-8f26-0e2d-179b" sortIndex="1">
      <costs>
        <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="100" />
      </costs>
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink targetId="ccc6-6202-853c-23e4" id="8e89-c568-f1c3-a78f" primary="true" name="Support" />
        <categoryLink targetId="6537-7b2d-b2c8-6005" id="4156-7762-bf9a-af89" primary="false" name="Monster" />
      </categoryLinks>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Reactive Gestation" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability" hidden="false" id="6559-05c7-8ced-ad04">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit Deploys, you may re-select this unit's weapon as you would during army list building.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Gastric Barrage" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability" hidden="false" id="2216-c6b3-effd-1ef8">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">While selecting targets for this unit's weapon, if you have no ready units except units with Gastric Barrage, you may'channel synaptic impulse'. If you do, you may instead target an enemy unit within 24" of and visible to any of your infantry units within 24" of this unit. Additionally, for each attack made for that weapon this turn, add 1 to the Hit Roll of that attack.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Spore Seeding" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability" hidden="false" id="a745-0597-367a-dd33">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">For each attack this unit makes, after the Hit Roll of that attack fails, create a spore mine unit with the same name as that attack's weapon within 6" of the selected unit outside of the engagement range of enemy units. That unit is not ready.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Mindless Impulses" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability" hidden="false" id="f5de-3f19-062e-09cd">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">This unit cannot become ready or be selected to gain relics. After rolling for initiative, this unit must Reposition and add 1 D6 to the Move Roll for that Reposition.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Atmospheric Disturbances" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability" hidden="false" id="66e0-bc57-0ad3-8e0e">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">Once per turn, after any enemy unit finishes an Advance, Reposition or Pile In, if that unit is within 12" of this unit, that unit is 'irritating' until the End step. Then, this unit must Reposition and must end that move as close as possible to the irritating unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Reflexive Burst" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability" hidden="false" id="f266-6075-b64a-714b">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit finishes a Reposition or Pile In within engagement range of one or more enemy units, for each enemy unit within engagement range of this unit, this unit must make attacks targeting that unit. Then, this unit dies.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Volatile Spores" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability" hidden="false" id="fbb5-bb54-5724-8f45">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">For each attack that targets this unit, each time the controlling player would make a Wound Roll for that attack, instead, you roll a D6. On a 1, this unit dies.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Walker" id="2d6a-280b-d19b-e338" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="4100-8e8c-47a5-3a15" />
      </infoLinks>
      <selectionEntries>
        <selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Biovore" hidden="false" id="63cc-38e4-9b26-4951">
          <constraints>
            <constraint type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="63cc-38e4-9b26-4951-min" includeChildSelections="false" />
